This is a suit for recovery filed by plaintiff against defendants, wherein, the following prayer(s)
are made:-
"a. Pass a decree for an amount of approximately Rs.28,68,911.36 (Rupees Twenty Eight Lacs Sixty Eight Thousand Nine Hundred Eleven and Paisa Thirty Six) along with interest 18% p.a. from 20.08.2015 till the realization of the full payment in favour of the plaintiff and jointly and severally against the defendants;
b. Pass an order awarding damages to the tune of Rs.1,00,00,000/- (Rupees One Crore Only) in favour of the plaintiff and jointly and severally against the defendants;
c. Pass an order awarding costs of the present suit in favour of the plaintiff and jointly and severally against the defendants."

